  "description": "Self-hosted web fonts for NuStreamDocs. Resolves a declarative font config at build time (Google Fonts, Fontsource, or local files), copies the woff2 into the site, generates the @font-face CSS and rel=preload links, and emits a system-font fallback with size-adjust / ascent-override metrics so the swap to the webfont causes zero layout shift. No third-party requests at runtime; no external CLI.",
